1881               /       CHECK IF CURRENTLY AT END OF NAME STRING. IF THERE ARE NO MORE NAME CHARACTERS
1882               /       TO MATCH THIS LATEST SEARCH STRING CHARACTER, THEN A MATCH IS IMPOSSIBLE.
1883               
1884 001433* 1360          TAD     FINDEX          /GET CURRENT NAME INDEX
1885 001434* 1053          TAD     L7772/[-6]      /COMPARE TO UPPER LIMIT
1886 001435* 7700          SMA CLA                 /SKIP IF LESS
1887 001436* 5312          JMP     NOMATCH         /JUMP IF TOO FAR
